# Docs, notes and agent files stay local; the repo ships implementation + README only.
# docs/ is the exception, and always has been for the file that carries the numbers' meaning: the
# reimplementation-deviations notes are cited by README and two system modules, so they have to ship.
# The rest of docs/ is now tracked too, because the research record (plan, decisions, reproduction)
# is the part that must survive a sandbox reset -- the results themselves only make sense with it.
*.md
!README.md
!/docs/*.md
/demo/

